rop-squarefree"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.prop-squarefree"],"id":"long.prop-squarefree","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Proposition 11.4 (Squarefree support: a limit of the certificate method, not an open value)","locator":"Long record Proposition 11.4, p. 131, label prop:squarefree","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*Let $A=\\{n\\ge2:n\\text{ is squarefree}\\}$. Then\n$$\nc_{A}(n)=2^{\\omega(n)}-1,\n$$\nwhich is odd for every $n\\ge2$. Consequently, at each even base, neither the digitwise nor the carry-aware divisibility-first block-certificate schema can supply certificates for every $q>0$.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/long.prop-squarefree","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/long.prop-squarefree","id":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/edges/%5B%22long.prop-squarefree%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_squarefree_support_engine_ceiling%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/edges/%5B%22long.prop-squarefree%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_squarefree_support_engine_ceiling%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_squarefree_support_engine_ceiling"},{"derived":true,"family":"provenance","from":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/long.prop-squarefree","id":"field:6bfee6893c6a68728d28898fc05c6dc9460979d5bc8bd7b4d76265e389fa4d14","kind":"source_id","owner_ref":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/long.prop-squarefree","semantic_class":"provenance